From: mscharged-port native source preparation
Subject: [PATCH] Transport original PE register and color-aperture requests
Upstream-base: d664382f57002fbff143911c81b06b7e7a4b3ab4
Classification: permanent native pixel-engine register/aperture hardware transport.

Retain eight literal reconstructed RVL PE setter bodies, substituting native
field insertion and actual16-bit independent PE register read/write transport.
Restore the source GXInit poke requests. Capture actual color aperture stores
and PE state in FIFO order, then encode real physical EFB writes on its worker.
Preserve normal draw viewport/scissor, channel masks, copy and finish ordering.
Coalesce only contiguous already-requested equal stores without intervening work.
Require the exact source GXInit PE0 ALWAYS depth mode; other depth requests
remain explicit holds. Qualify loading NONE/ALWAYS/non-dither/destination-alpha-off at
1:1 single-sample RGB8 or RGBA6 endpoint components; unsupported execution fails.
No Charged source, bitmap, scene flow, initialization request or readiness change.
Compose after original recording0033 on exact nativeSDK29+0032 provider preimages.

